## Publish to MyTools Hub

Bump `version` in `plugin.json` (must be higher than any previously published version), then:

```bash
npm run build
npm run publish:hub
```

Requires a signed-in MyTools Hub session (`%AppData%/MyTools.Desktop/HubSession.json`) or `MYTOOLS_HUB_TOKEN` / `MYTOOLS_HUB_URL`.
